/**
 * EXPR_ASSIGN ELF emit (FIELD / INDEX / VAR / DEREF; slice dual-GP, fixed-array
 * whole assign, STRUCT_LIT index in-place, esz>8 bulk copy).
 * @param arena *u8 - ASTArena*
