// wave216: for_call_args mega pure leave
// (was Cap residual pipeline_asm_emit_call_args.c pipeline_asm_emit_expr_elf_for_call_args)
// G.7 product authority for freestanding CALL-arg packing into rax[/rdx] or lea:
